WEBVTT

00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:03.550
Here y'go.

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:05.710
Whoa, whoa...

00:00:08.230 --> 00:00:10.700
She truly is the epitome of gluttony.

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:14.240
It's apparently a repercussion of 
trying to improve her lifestyle.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:20.030
Don't tell me you've caught a cold.

00:00:20.030 --> 00:00:20.990
Of course not!

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:23.870
Some prince somewhere 
must be talking about me!

00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:26.210
Oh? Tryin' to marry into money, huh?

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:29.420
No thanks! I'm gonna 
join the Chinese zodiac!

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:38.300
<b>Oden</b>

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:34.660
I'm so full.

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:37.010
I'm gonna go home now!

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:41.720
Ugh...

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:44.060
Is she okay?

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:10.710
<b>ETOTAMA</b>

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:35.250
<b>Episode 5: Nutritious Sheep Fortification</b>

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:32.200
Smells great!

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:33.410
It looks so good!

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:44.400
Shar-tan's special curry is almost ready!

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:45.260
Yeah!

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:47.580
By the way, Key-tan, Inu-tan,

00:02:47.580 --> 00:02:49.850
how do you like living at Takeru-san's place?

00:02:50.110 --> 00:02:51.730
It's super nice!

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:54.800
I mean, it comes with meals, 
baths, and even Sol/Lull!

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:56.570
I think my shoulders even feel less stiff!

00:02:56.980 --> 00:02:58.600
Takeru-san's Sol/Lull

00:02:58.600 --> 00:03:01.250
permeates through the floor and walls.

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:03.770
It's like far-infrared light therapy.

00:03:03.770 --> 00:03:05.240
Takeru's amazing!

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:08.020
It really is the ultimate Sol/Lull.

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:10.210
Nyummy!

00:03:10.680 --> 00:03:12.920
Curry really piques my appetite!

00:03:13.530 --> 00:03:15.890
I feel like it's missing something, though.

00:03:15.890 --> 00:03:17.080
Really?

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:18.010
<b>Sesame Oil</b>

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:18.010
Then I'll add this.

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:19.390
Stop!

00:03:19.390 --> 00:03:21.230
Don't put in sesame oil!

00:03:21.230 --> 00:03:23.890
You know it'll clash with the curry spices!

00:03:25.090 --> 00:03:26.350
Then what should I put in?

00:03:27.940 --> 00:03:31.940
It just so happens I have a secret 
ingredient that should match curry well.

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:32.880
What?

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:34.250
A mysterious liquid?

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:35.820
It's not mysterious.

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:39.120
It's a spice I made by 
mixing Sol/Lull extracts.

00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:41.790
Sol/Lull extract?! Give it 
to me! Give it all to me!

00:03:41.790 --> 00:03:43.670
Oh, I can't do that.

00:03:43.670 --> 00:03:45.570
I made it just for this curry.

00:03:47.230 --> 00:03:48.920
Just a tiny bit, then!

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:48.040
Meow

00:03:48.920 --> 00:03:50.620
Give me some Sol/Lull!

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:49.750
Meow

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:51.830
<b>Grr...</b>

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:51.830
Grr...

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:55.290
Nope. Making that face won't change my mind.

00:03:55.570 --> 00:03:57.780
How are you not annoyed, Mei-tan?

00:03:57.780 --> 00:03:58.670
Huh?

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:01.100
"Angel in white" certainly 
is a fitting nickname.

00:04:01.100 --> 00:04:02.380
Though she's a god, not an angel.

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:03.730
Found an opening!

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:09.850
Oh, no! The curry's turning 
a fantastic color!

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:11.770
It doesn't look like we can eat that.

00:04:12.260 --> 00:04:13.630
It's all right.

00:04:13.630 --> 00:04:17.580
All she added is a spice that's essential 
for us gods to maintain good health.

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:19.860
It's health-fortification curry.

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:23.530
It's the Sol/Lull that matters here!

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:25.780
All that precious Sol/Lull is gone now!

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:27.700
Sol/Lull?

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:29.450
I can get more of that right now.

00:04:31.420 --> 00:04:34.190
You didn't even do anything, 
and look at all that Sol/Lull!

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:36.830
That's what the zodiac gods can do.

00:04:37.150 --> 00:04:39.670
Lucky! I wish I could just go "hee-hee"

00:04:39.980 --> 00:04:42.860
and automatically soak up 
all the Sol/Lull I want!

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:45.630
If you want Sol/Lull, 
can't you just get it from Takeru?

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:50.150
Takeru hasn't put out much Sol/Lull since

00:04:50.150 --> 00:04:51.870
Uri-tan's reincarnation incident.

00:04:51.870 --> 00:04:53.940
He's at a highly mistrustful age.

00:04:53.940 --> 00:04:56.020
You got what you deserved, stupid cat.

00:04:57.280 --> 00:04:59.730
I wonder if Takeru's still sleeping.

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:02.010
Now that you mention it, 
he hasn't come down yet.

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:05.240
All right! I'll wake him up and squeeze 
out his first Sol/Lull of the morning!

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:07.070
Meow, meow, meow!

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:10.710
And that's why she can't 
get any Sol/Lull from him.

00:05:13.340 --> 00:05:15.040
Takeru!

00:05:15.320 --> 00:05:16.780
Good morning!

00:05:16.780 --> 00:05:18.420
Wake up, Takeru!

00:05:19.700 --> 00:05:20.720
This is...

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:22.890
<i>Takeru is finally becoming</i>

00:05:22.890 --> 00:05:25.170
<i>aware of me as a woman!</i>

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:27.540
<i>It's okay, Takeru.</i>

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:30.880
<i>Give me all the Sol/Lull you like...</i>

00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:33.540
Smooch.

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:36.960
Ow, hot!

00:05:38.610 --> 00:05:39.900
Takeru?

00:05:50.690 --> 00:05:52.890
Well? What's wrong with Takeru?

00:05:53.190 --> 00:05:54.240
He has a cold.

00:05:54.550 --> 00:05:57.190
A cold? But he looks really miserable.

00:05:57.190 --> 00:05:58.120
It's only a cold?

00:05:58.430 --> 00:06:02.130
I'll figure out the exact 
cause and make some medicine.

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:10.220
What's that?

00:06:15.780 --> 00:06:17.750
Wha— Wha—

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:20.550
What is this?!

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:24.250
Everyone's in swimsuits for some reason!

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:26.790
We're suddenly heading 
into a swimsuit episode!

00:06:26.790 --> 00:06:28.260
Oh, my...

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:30.180
Again?!

00:06:31.380 --> 00:06:33.500
Wha— Wha—

00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:36.430
What is this?!

00:06:39.790 --> 00:06:41.920
There's no bath, 
but they're all in bath towels!

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:44.420
It's going from a swimsuit episode 
to a hot spring episode now!

00:06:45.690 --> 00:06:48.090
His Sol/Lull isn't in very good shape.

00:06:49.140 --> 00:06:50.440
I understand.

00:06:50.440 --> 00:06:52.820
The Sol/Lull of the young man down with a cold

00:06:52.820 --> 00:06:56.150
is being emitted regardless of his will.

00:06:56.150 --> 00:06:59.610
Yes... And the Sol/Lull 
being emitted is unstable,

00:06:59.610 --> 00:07:01.970
varying between weak and strong.

00:07:01.970 --> 00:07:03.610
It's very unique Sol/Lull.

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:05.680
So that's why we look like this.

00:07:05.680 --> 00:07:08.180
Our clothes are made from 
Sol/Lull, after all.

00:07:08.180 --> 00:07:09.490
Bath towels are "clothes"?

00:07:09.830 --> 00:07:12.820
I'm sorry! I'm sorry for 
exposing myself like this!

00:07:13.100 --> 00:07:15.950
But why haven't I changed at all?

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:18.120
Am I totally ruled out when 
it comes to sex appeal?!

00:07:18.350 --> 00:07:22.020
Calm down, Nya-tan. Mei-tan 
hasn't changed, either.

00:07:22.470 --> 00:07:26.040
Which means it must have 
nothing to do with sex appeal.

00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:29.670
I don't often get sick in the first place.

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:33.410
Then I must be fine because 
I live well every day!

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:37.260
Yay!

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:34.950
<i>It's because she's an idiot.</i>

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:35.970
<i>Because she's an idiot.</i>

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:37.260
<i>Idiots don't get sick.</i>

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:38.120
Fantastic!

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:39.440
She's impressive, all right.

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:42.820
Now that we've had swimsuits 
and bath towels...

00:07:43.450 --> 00:07:45.810
Next is nakedness! Everyone's gonna be naked!

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:45.810
<b>NAKED</b>

00:07:48.590 --> 00:07:52.240
It's coming! We'll be 
in DVD and Blu-ray mode!

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:54.660
And no light beams, please!

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:02.920
Wha— Wha—

00:08:03.230 --> 00:08:06.370
What is that?!

00:08:06.370 --> 00:08:09.420
Why are you acting so disappointed?

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:13.420
I'm speaking for the viewers! 
I represent all of them!

00:08:13.420 --> 00:08:16.510
Oh, that's right! 
We can't show it on the air,

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:18.830
but in the disc versions, 
the light will be gone!

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:22.070
These are drawn on the cels. 
They won't come off.

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:25.900
Nya-tan, my sweetheart!

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:27.370
Don't cry!

00:08:27.370 --> 00:08:29.820
If my nude body will do, 
I'll be as nude as you want!

00:08:30.100 --> 00:08:32.620
What? Is she trying to take off the light?

00:08:32.620 --> 00:08:34.860
That's stupid! She's stupid!

00:08:40.940 --> 00:08:41.750
Inu!

00:08:50.950 --> 00:08:52.600
What is this chaos?!

00:08:52.600 --> 00:08:54.550
How much energy are they trying 
to expend on the animation?!

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:58.640
Why are they actually starting 
to test each other's strength?!

00:09:00.470 --> 00:09:02.100
My master suddenly made a run for it?!

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:08.370
And she looks like she's in serious agony!

00:09:08.370 --> 00:09:10.870
It looks like the out-of-control 
Sol/Lull made not just her feet,

00:09:10.870 --> 00:09:13.490
but her entire body an erogenous zone.

00:09:14.760 --> 00:09:17.170
She's a total 18-and-up-only Eto-shin now...

00:09:18.340 --> 00:09:19.240
What's wrong?

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:20.650
Kee-kee-kee-kee!

00:09:20.650 --> 00:09:22.200
Inu! Inu! Inu! Inu!

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:24.000
Right, uh-huh, uh-huh...

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:25.700
Like I understand that!

00:09:25.700 --> 00:09:27.500
Also, dogs say "woof"!

00:09:30.020 --> 00:09:31.630
You're back to normal?

00:09:33.480 --> 00:09:35.240
What's going on?

00:09:36.610 --> 00:09:38.620
When you smack them in retort,

00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:42.370
the out-of-control Sol/Lull seems 
to be ejected from their bodies.

00:09:42.370 --> 00:09:44.890
So if I smack all of them with retorts,

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:46.680
they'll all go back to normal?

00:09:46.680 --> 00:09:49.780
Well, yes, but it's only temporar—

00:09:49.780 --> 00:09:51.020
Here I go!

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:53.030
Forgive me! I'm sorry!

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:55.300
I'm sorry I'm dressed like this!

00:09:55.300 --> 00:09:58.500
Ah, how I envy Mo-tan...

00:09:58.500 --> 00:10:01.030
I envy people with nice bodies...

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:03.290
Envy!

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:07.000
You sound more like a bound 
spirit than an Eto-shin!

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:09.000
All right! Next!

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:14.880
If I go anywhere near this one, 
it's gonna get annoying.

00:10:15.730 --> 00:10:16.730
An explosion?!

00:10:16.730 --> 00:10:19.640
Oh, dear. They've all started to rampage.

00:10:19.980 --> 00:10:22.100
We need to find a way to 
deal with this, quickly.

00:10:25.980 --> 00:10:27.540
My house is destroyed!

00:10:30.670 --> 00:10:32.150
My house is rebuilt!

00:10:32.150 --> 00:10:33.360
What kind of self-fulfilled work is that?!

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:41.320
Destroyed again?! What are you doing?!

00:10:41.810 --> 00:10:42.950
Don't feel.

00:10:43.270 --> 00:10:44.080
Think!

00:10:44.300 --> 00:10:47.080
I am thinking, and I don't 
get it! That's why I asked!

00:10:47.360 --> 00:10:48.540
Nya-tan...

00:10:48.860 --> 00:10:51.610
You've got some nice skin, don't ya?

00:10:51.610 --> 00:10:55.130
She's pretending this is casual skinship, 
but she already has me in a lock!

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:56.590
I can't move a single finger!

00:10:57.660 --> 00:10:59.970
Even if she does something dumb, 
I can't smack her now!

00:11:00.280 --> 00:11:03.600
Rub, rubbity-rub...

00:11:05.490 --> 00:11:07.180
You're a leopard, not a tiger?

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:09.410
Wait, a leopardess?!

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:11.450
I... I can't smack her...

00:11:11.820 --> 00:11:14.440
I never let my prey escape.

00:11:14.680 --> 00:11:17.610
An erotic development?
Or is she really trying to eat me?!

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:20.070
I don't know which it is, 
but I don't like either one!

00:11:23.550 --> 00:11:26.540
Stop! Can't you see she doesn't like that?

00:11:26.900 --> 00:11:29.490
This feels so wrong, 
my hair's standing on end!

00:11:29.490 --> 00:11:32.630
My lovely princess, please don't cry.

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:39.480
I will fight for my beloved lady!

00:11:39.480 --> 00:11:40.920
I'm gonna gobble her up!

00:11:41.810 --> 00:11:43.720
You're both nothing but perverts!

00:11:46.250 --> 00:11:47.720
You're one tough master!

00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:51.190
Nya-tan, as fellow felines, 
let us caterwaul together!

00:11:51.190 --> 00:11:52.940
What are you, an old man?!

00:11:52.940 --> 00:11:55.400
I will protect her chastity or die trying!

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:57.160
Then go ahead and die!

00:11:57.160 --> 00:11:59.940
Also, you're the one putting 
my chastity in danger!

00:12:01.390 --> 00:12:02.910
You're back already?!

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:06.200
Nya-tan, let's make out! Unify! Become one!

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:07.490
No more, old man!

00:12:07.720 --> 00:12:08.330
I will—

00:12:08.570 --> 00:12:09.830
Shut up, pervert!

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:12.780
I'm in trouble...

00:12:12.780 --> 00:12:15.560
I keep smacking them, 
but they keep coming back.

00:12:15.560 --> 00:12:18.460
I actually would appreciate 
even a cat's help right now...

00:12:19.220 --> 00:12:21.830
Nya-tan, I've got it!

00:12:21.830 --> 00:12:24.450
What, I have to take a sheep's help?!

00:12:24.450 --> 00:12:28.010
The out-of-control Sol/Lull is being 
caused by the "divine cold virus."

00:12:28.590 --> 00:12:30.400
Divine cold virus?

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:36.020
<b>[Zodiac Precepts ~Article 3: Qualifications] The Conference 
of Gods selects 108 Eto-musume and 12 Eto-shin to 
participate in the Eto-shin Selection Festival (ETM12), 
granting them Sol/Lull Seals as proof of their qualification.</b>

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:41.070
<b>[Zodiac Precepts ~Article 4: Battle Procedure] Immediately after 
an Eto-musume invokes her right to issue an inescapable 
challenge to an Eto-shin, and accepts the Eto-shin's stated 
conditions for victory, the battle for the Sol/Lull Seal begins.</b>

00:12:45.920 --> 00:12:49.200
So what is this divine cold virus, anyway?

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:52.660
It's an illness brought on by a virus 
that only occurs in the Eto realm.

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:55.390
It multiplies within Sol/Lull.

00:12:55.690 --> 00:12:58.750
No human has ever been known to catch it...

00:12:59.170 --> 00:13:01.740
Takeru-san's Sol/Lull is special.

00:13:01.740 --> 00:13:03.670
Maybe that has something to do with it?

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:06.720
Uri-tan, you're awfully 
calm amidst all this chaos.

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:14.310
<b>All There Is to Know 
About Sesame Oil</b>

00:13:06.990 --> 00:13:08.290
Am I?

00:13:08.290 --> 00:13:10.590
Well, panicking won't do any good.

00:13:10.590 --> 00:13:13.520
It seems like I just keep getting smaller.

00:13:13.820 --> 00:13:17.180
I'm not going to die or anything, 
so I can just wait unti—

00:13:22.280 --> 00:13:23.420
She died.

00:13:25.140 --> 00:13:25.740
Takeru?!

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:31.950
The divine cold virus is spreading 
at a terrifying rate...

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:34.400
If it keeps up, all of Takeru-san's

00:13:34.400 --> 00:13:36.330
Sol/Lull will be devoured!

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:39.000
What'll happen if it gets devoured?

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:42.580
Takeru-san won't wake up. Ever.

00:13:42.580 --> 00:13:44.920
No way! Wh-What do we do?

00:13:45.530 --> 00:13:49.470
The only way is to enter his Sol/Lull 
directly and treat it there.

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:52.590
Enter his Sol/Lull? Is that possible?

00:13:52.590 --> 00:13:54.520
With my ability, it is.

00:13:55.130 --> 00:13:59.130
But Takeru-san will be utterly 
defenseless while he's being treated.

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:03.130
If he takes even the smallest blow, 
his condition will become critical.

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:04.860
So what do we do?

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:07.290
Protect Takeru-san's body.

00:14:08.020 --> 00:14:10.760
You're the only one I can count on, Nya-tan.

00:14:11.060 --> 00:14:13.450
Y-You're counting on... me?

00:14:13.450 --> 00:14:14.260
Yes.

00:14:15.180 --> 00:14:16.080
Nya-tan!

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:17.710
I got it!

00:14:18.470 --> 00:14:20.600
We haven't had much to do

00:14:20.600 --> 00:14:22.630
with each other before, but...

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:24.660
Right now,

00:14:24.660 --> 00:14:27.440
we share the same desire 
to make Takeru better!

00:14:27.440 --> 00:14:28.220
Yes!

00:14:30.100 --> 00:14:31.600
Derp...

00:14:32.860 --> 00:14:35.410
Derp...

00:14:32.860 --> 00:14:36.270
Mei-tan, leave these idiots 
to me and go inside him!

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:39.900
Derp...

00:14:40.220 --> 00:14:41.620
Mei-tan, hurry!

00:14:40.220 --> 00:14:42.440
Derp...

00:14:45.620 --> 00:14:48.700
Made in Sol/Lull!

00:14:52.590 --> 00:14:54.070
Off I go!

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:11.140
There!

00:15:21.630 --> 00:15:23.560
Huh? Mei-tan?

00:15:23.970 --> 00:15:26.170
Hang in there just a bit longer, Takeru-san.

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:29.030
I'll fix you up in no time.

00:15:42.560 --> 00:15:44.360
That completes the treatment.

00:15:45.020 --> 00:15:47.550
It's okay now, Takeru-san!

00:15:48.290 --> 00:15:50.420
Th-Thanks...

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:51.860
It's all right.

00:15:51.860 --> 00:15:54.930
My job is to look after the health of humans.

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:59.310
As long as humans are healthy, 
the world will be at peace!

00:15:59.690 --> 00:16:02.360
Those are really nice words.

00:16:06.970 --> 00:16:08.900
You think so, too?

00:16:10.220 --> 00:16:11.320
I'm glad.

00:16:11.850 --> 00:16:14.130
You know, 2,000 years ago,

00:16:14.130 --> 00:16:16.850
when I was given a position as an Eto-shin,

00:16:16.850 --> 00:16:19.830
those were the words of the person 
who gave my life a purpose.

00:16:20.280 --> 00:16:22.370
You're a fascinating person, Takeru-san.

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:25.510
I've never told anyone this before.

00:16:27.030 --> 00:16:29.020
Oh, you fell asleep?

00:16:32.180 --> 00:16:33.550
The divine cold virus!

00:16:37.250 --> 00:16:39.060
A new variation?!

00:16:44.070 --> 00:16:45.650
It's trying to get outside?

00:16:48.470 --> 00:16:50.840
Derp...

00:16:49.020 --> 00:16:50.030
Derp... Derp...

00:16:50.840 --> 00:16:54.060
Derp...

00:16:58.560 --> 00:16:59.760
Who are you?!

00:16:59.760 --> 00:17:02.750
I am all in one, and one in all.

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:05.380
I reign over all realms,

00:17:05.380 --> 00:17:07.380
godly and mortal, 
and put even gods to sleep.

00:17:07.980 --> 00:17:10.930
Eh? What? All in one? All realms?

00:17:10.930 --> 00:17:14.220
Foolish creature who hears not my voice...

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:15.730
Huh? Goulash?

00:17:16.990 --> 00:17:19.840
I am the true divine cold virus!

00:17:19.840 --> 00:17:22.870
Oh, right! You're the one I've heard of!

00:17:22.870 --> 00:17:25.680
The one causing havoc everywhere right now,

00:17:25.680 --> 00:17:27.440
the divine cold virus!

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:29.900
Wait! So this was

00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:31.820
all your doing?!

00:17:31.820 --> 00:17:33.280
<i>D-Delayed retort?</i>

00:17:36.340 --> 00:17:38.000
Cut it out already!

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:40.030
I'm sorry!

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:41.370
<i>It's gone...</i>

00:17:41.640 --> 00:17:44.510
Sheesh, what a trouble-making virus.

00:17:46.610 --> 00:17:48.320
When did I end up naked?!

00:17:50.160 --> 00:17:52.940
You used all your Sol/Lull, 
including your clothes,

00:17:52.940 --> 00:17:54.560
for that last retort.

00:17:54.560 --> 00:17:55.550
No way!

00:17:56.010 --> 00:17:59.340
That's just how much of your 
heart you put into that whack.

00:17:59.340 --> 00:18:00.760
That was amazing, Nya-tan.

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:03.170
Huh? R-Really?

00:18:07.770 --> 00:18:10.190
Oh, Takeru looks peaceful now!

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:13.000
Now his treatment really is complete.

00:18:14.300 --> 00:18:16.570
Ow! My hand hurts!

00:18:16.570 --> 00:18:19.180
Oh, my. You've done too much smacking.

00:18:19.180 --> 00:18:20.510
Wait just a moment.

00:18:21.180 --> 00:18:21.870
There.

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:25.420
Wow! The pain is going away by the second!

00:18:27.140 --> 00:18:28.620
A Sol/Lull Seal?

00:18:28.950 --> 00:18:32.780
My Sol/Lull Seal works 
well for bruises, sprains,

00:18:32.780 --> 00:18:34.880
cuts, and fractures.

00:18:35.200 --> 00:18:36.710
I can have this?

00:18:36.710 --> 00:18:37.400
Yes.

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:39.230
All right!

00:18:39.230 --> 00:18:42.100
Mei-tan's Sol/Lull Seal is mine!

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:42.100
<b>Sheep</b>

00:18:42.400 --> 00:18:45.380
Yay! Yay! I did it!

00:18:45.830 --> 00:18:47.910
You're so funny, Nya-tan.

00:18:48.660 --> 00:18:51.820
If an Eto-musume like you joined the zodiac,

00:18:51.820 --> 00:18:54.400
perhaps something would change.

00:18:54.780 --> 00:18:56.530
And then, maybe she would...

00:19:02.300 --> 00:19:03.630
What happened?

00:19:03.630 --> 00:19:05.160
What on Earth...

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:07.110
...were we just doing?

00:19:12.450 --> 00:19:14.900
What're you laughin' at?

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:16.890
Get some clothes on.

00:19:16.890 --> 00:19:18.980
Ya may be an idiot, 
but you're gonna catch a cold.

00:19:18.980 --> 00:19:20.290
That's right.

00:19:20.290 --> 00:19:23.520
You had a terribly runny nose earlier.

00:19:23.520 --> 00:19:25.100
Are ya over that cold?

00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:26.970
I had a cold?

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:28.770
<b>Oden</b>

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:30.440
Last night, you were sneezin' up a storm.

00:19:30.670 --> 00:19:33.270
What could it have been but a cold?

00:19:33.710 --> 00:19:35.270
Oh, now that you mention it...

00:19:36.990 --> 00:19:39.010
I'm back!

00:19:39.010 --> 00:19:40.460
Brr...

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:42.570
It's cold in here.

00:19:45.180 --> 00:19:46.530
Achoo!

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:50.990
Ah, nice and warm.

00:19:51.690 --> 00:19:53.270
C-Cold...

00:19:58.670 --> 00:20:00.200
Maybe it happened then.

00:20:00.200 --> 00:20:02.390
You clearly gave your

00:20:02.390 --> 00:20:04.530
divine cold to Takeru-san.

00:20:04.980 --> 00:20:08.980
Oh, no, no, no! It couldn't be!

00:20:16.330 --> 00:20:17.440
Nya-tan...

00:20:18.750 --> 00:20:20.620
You let the divine cold virus beat you,

00:20:20.620 --> 00:20:23.330
and even brought about a new variation.

00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:26.450
You are far too unhealthy.

00:20:26.770 --> 00:20:27.610
Meow?!

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:31.210
You'll need a vaccination to 
prevent this from happening again.

00:20:32.340 --> 00:20:34.330
Of course, I'll need all

00:20:34.330 --> 00:20:36.790
the rest of you to line up, too.

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:40.840
I-I-I...

00:20:41.360 --> 00:20:43.840
I refuse!

00:20:44.280 --> 00:20:45.320
For goodness' sake...

00:20:45.320 --> 00:20:48.590
I'll make sure you all get a shot later.

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:49.980
Mei-tan?

00:20:50.960 --> 00:20:53.190
Takeru-san! You're awake?

00:20:55.630 --> 00:20:58.010
Yes, you're all better.

00:20:58.890 --> 00:21:02.070
You'll be fine now. You did very well.

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:05.730
You're the one who did well, aren't you?

00:21:07.510 --> 00:21:08.450
Thanks.

00:21:13.070 --> 00:21:13.960
Mei-tan?

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:16.620
Ah... U-Um...

00:21:17.140 --> 00:21:19.370
I... I...

00:21:20.440 --> 00:21:21.880
I don't get sick, but...

00:21:22.750 --> 00:21:25.550
I think I've just come 
down with lovesickness.

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:29.010
Oh, dear... What a problem...

00:21:29.010 --> 00:21:30.570
Are you... okay?

00:21:30.570 --> 00:21:34.200
To think you would worry 
for my sake, Takeru-san!

00:21:34.200 --> 00:21:37.490
Er, um... I mean...
What happened to you?

00:21:34.560 --> 00:21:37.490
I'm so happy!

00:21:47.000 --> 00:21:49.990
Looks like she's obtained 
Mei-tan's Sol/Lull Seal.

00:21:53.720 --> 00:21:57.500
Is your heart still beyond salvation?

00:21:58.070 --> 00:21:59.310
I need

00:22:00.590 --> 00:22:03.040
neither salvation nor light.

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:44.730
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:35.840 --> 00:23:38.480
Here's the flower fortune for those 
of you born in the year of the sheep!

00:23:38.480 --> 00:23:40.310
He loves me... He loves me not...

00:23:40.310 --> 00:23:42.590
I love Takeru-san!

00:23:42.590 --> 00:23:44.730
I just love him! I love him like crazy!

00:23:44.730 --> 00:23:46.730
Next time: The Three Laughers 
of the Tiger's Scheme.

00:23:44.730 --> 00:23:50.030
<b>The Three Laughers of the Tiger's Scheme</b>

00:23:46.730 --> 00:23:47.800
Where's Takeru-san?

00:23:47.800 --> 00:23:50.030
He has a headache, so he's off this week.

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:53.990
<b>I'll heal your heart!</b>

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:53.990
<b>I hope you'll watch again next week!</b>

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:53.990
<b>Sheep</b>

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:53.990
<b>Illustration: Fuchigami Mai</b>
